====================================================================================================
v126  BOND DIMENSION OF THE WEIGHT VECTOR:  can the prep be truncated?
====================================================================================================
  v125: the weighted prep is Theta(|D|) by parameter counting, for an
  ARBITRARY distribution. An MPS at bond dimension chi preps in O(d*chi^2).
  So: are real weight vectors low-rank? Vectors are TIER A (circuits,
  32768 shots, real descent); the SVD of them is TIER C, NO CIRCUIT.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
