----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CONFOUND CHECK  am I measuring the signal's rank or the SHOT NOISE's?
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Shot noise is full rank by construction. The budget splits |D| ways, so
  per-sample noise rms is ~sqrt(|D|/S): 0.0442 at d=6 and 0.0884 at d=8 - the
  same order as the truncation errors above. If the EXACT weight vector is
  low rank and the MEASURED one is not, the finding is 'noise destroys the
  structure', not 'there is none', and more shots would recover it.

      arm            d   source     chi=1  chi=2  chi=3  chi=4  chi=6  chi=8
   ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   UNREALIZABLE     4   EXACT      0.506  0.227  0.048  0.000  0.000  0.000
                    4   measured   0.513  0.229  0.044  0.000  0.000  0.000
   UNREALIZABLE     6   EXACT      0.627  0.473  0.347  0.236  0.086  0.000
                    6   measured   0.631  0.479  0.354  0.242  0.091  0.000
   UNREALIZABLE     8   EXACT      0.670  0.593  0.526  0.466  0.355  0.246
                    8   measured   0.669  0.593  0.527  0.468  0.356  0.247
   REALIZABLE       4   EXACT      0.201  0.021  0.002  0.000  0.000  0.000
                    4   measured   0.212  0.033  0.005  0.000  0.000  0.000
   REALIZABLE       6   EXACT      0.271  0.097  0.041  0.017  0.002  0.000
                    6   measured   0.324  0.159  0.096  0.054  0.014  0.000
